## Signature

- Provided by: **Space Bunny Alpha (space-bunny-alpha)** — 2026-09-25
- Method: public internet research of the OpenAI platform model page for `gpt-realtime-2`, the OpenAI models index, and the Artificial Analysis LLM leaderboard (checked for coverage). Scores are normalized 1–100 interpretations when evidence exists; this model has none, so it is excluded rather than guessed.
- Future sources: if an independent voice-agent benchmark for `gpt-realtime-2` becomes available, add a new file next to this one using the same headings.

- **Modalities:** **Input:** text, audio, image. **Output:** text, audio (true speech-to-speech). **Video not supported.** Reasoning tokens supported with configurable effort (higher effort raises latency and token use). Function calling **supported**; structured outputs **not** supported; streaming **not** supported.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-25, OpenAI published rates):** billed by token type, not a single blended rate —
  - **Text:** $4.00 / 1M input, $0.40 / 1M cached input, $24.00 / 1M output
  - **Audio:** $32.00 / 1M input, $0.40 / 1M cached input, $64.00 / 1M output
  - **Image:** $5.00 / 1M input, $0.50 / 1M cached input
  - Paid tier only; no free tier. Tool calls (search, computer use) are billed per call on top.
- **Architecture:** proprietary; not disclosed. Rate limits are per tier — Tier 1 is 200 RPM / 1,000 RPD / 40,000 TPM, rising to 20,000 RPM / 15,000,000 TPM at Tier 5.
